                                                "sense_id": "3f912a90-51bb-3950-b51e-80b3797ce6cc",
                                                "text": "1717 November 20, Alexander Pope, letter to the Bishop of Rochester\nthere was a collection of all that had been written […] : I warmed my head with them."
                                            },
