                                                "sense_id": "ed88bb6d-f3a4-32f7-b642-66b362dc3ba6",
                                                "text": "Not bothering to turn around and not missing a mouthful, Myrtle comforted her with threats of \"I'll warm your bottom\"; \"I'll turn you over to your dad\"; \"I'll lock you in the truck\"; \"I'll send for the bogey man\" — all of which Darleen ignored […]"
                                            }
